{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43026","headline":"勖曹生 · 卢鉟","name":"勖曹生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑扈交飞百舌忙，祖亭闻乐倍思乡。\n尊前有恨惭卑宦，席上无憀爱艳妆。\n莫爲狂花迷眼界，须求真理定心王。\n游蜂采掇何时已，祗恐多言议短长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鉟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}